1
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:18,880
[Eight years ago]

2
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:47,840
Jiaxian.

3
00:00:48,980 --> 00:00:49,860
Did you

4
00:00:50,640 --> 00:00:51,720
go see Mr. Du?

5
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:55,160
This is my business.

6
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,400
Stay out of it.

7
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,840
Since we've tied the knot,

8
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,750
we're husband and wife.

9
00:00:58,750 --> 00:01:00,020
Your business is my business.

10
00:01:00,020 --> 00:01:01,280
How can I stay out of it?

11
00:01:01,470 --> 00:01:02,150
Tell me:

12
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:03,710
what's going on?

13
00:01:04,230 --> 00:01:06,840
It's just spending 20,000 silver dollars
to rebuild Immortal Temple.

14
00:01:06,840 --> 00:01:07,960
As long as Jialiang and Jiashu

15
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,160
can come back safely,

16
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:11,190
there's nothing I can't give up.

17
00:01:11,190 --> 00:01:13,350
That blind man Du
told you this, didn't he?

18
00:01:13,350 --> 00:01:14,680
Haven't you considered

19
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:16,570
that he might be lying to you?

20
00:01:16,570 --> 00:01:17,910
I don't care if he's blind or deaf.

21
00:01:17,910 --> 00:01:20,090
You were the ones who made me trust him
in the first place!

22
00:01:20,090 --> 00:01:22,560
Why is it doing a good deed
when you believe him,

23
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:24,020
but being fooled when I do?

24
00:01:24,640 --> 00:01:24,970
No...

25
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,710
These are two different things.

26
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:29,330
What if we lose our entire fortune

27
00:01:29,330 --> 00:01:30,789
-and still can't save—
-Jiang Feiyan!

28
00:01:30,789 --> 00:01:33,240
Are the lives of my brother and sister
more important,

29
00:01:33,240 --> 00:01:34,960
or is our family's money?

30
00:01:41,870 --> 00:01:42,509
I'm sorry.

31
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:44,240
I'm sorry.

32
00:01:44,890 --> 00:01:46,060
I didn't mean that.

33
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:47,430
I've been...

34
00:01:48,350 --> 00:01:49,080
I've been...

35
00:01:49,229 --> 00:01:49,759
Alright.

36
00:01:49,880 --> 00:01:51,479
Everything's been counted.

37
00:01:58,539 --> 00:01:59,870
If you want to help me,

38
00:02:01,920 --> 00:02:03,580
take good care of Stepmother.

39
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:04,210
Jiaxian.

40
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:05,080
Jia...

41
00:03:58,230 --> 00:04:01,930
[A Prophet]

42
00:04:02,770 --> 00:04:04,850
[Episode 3]

43
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,680
You hit the nail on the head, Master.

44
00:04:07,810 --> 00:04:08,800
Sure enough, Chen Jiarong

45
00:04:08,800 --> 00:04:11,280
wasn't about to let me
monopolize the gold mine.

46
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,150
It's to be expected.

47
00:04:13,420 --> 00:04:15,840
Once we get our hands on that
50,000 silver dollars from the mine sale,

48
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,440
shouldn't we reel in the net?

49
00:04:18,500 --> 00:04:19,820
You're too impatient.

50
00:04:20,190 --> 00:04:21,720
This is just the beginning.

51
00:04:21,870 --> 00:04:23,870
We must always finish what we start.

52
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,560
After all the work we put into this setup,

53
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:27,160
we have to stick the landing.

54
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,240
So you mean...

55
00:04:29,300 --> 00:04:30,500
Play your role

56
00:04:30,800 --> 00:04:32,560
as Lin Shengxiang well.

57
00:04:33,060 --> 00:04:35,659
I'll keep you informed about the rest.

58
00:04:40,510 --> 00:04:41,120
Uncle,

59
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,200
I've thought it through.

60
00:04:43,950 --> 00:04:44,830
This mine...

61
00:04:46,680 --> 00:04:48,080
should all belong to you.

62
00:04:48,430 --> 00:04:49,600
What are you saying?

63
00:04:50,310 --> 00:04:51,870
We agreed on half and half,

64
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:53,560
but now you're giving it all to me?

65
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:54,830
If word gets out,

66
00:04:55,159 --> 00:04:57,040
what will people say about me?

67
00:04:57,120 --> 00:04:57,630
Uncle,

68
00:04:58,240 --> 00:04:59,970
this has nothing to do with you.

69
00:05:00,310 --> 00:05:01,770
It's entirely voluntary.

70
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,330
What exactly happened?

71
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,070
Mr. Lin,

72
00:05:08,480 --> 00:05:09,920
there's darkness between your brows.

73
00:05:09,920 --> 00:05:11,720
It seems misfortune is upon you.

74
00:05:12,190 --> 00:05:13,510
Your surname Lin comprises Wood.

75
00:05:13,510 --> 00:05:15,000
You're born under the Fire element.

76
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,390
Wood and Fire are in bright harmony,
and the Bing Fire is fierce.

77
00:05:17,390 --> 00:05:20,070
If it were a tin mine,
you could run it.

78
00:05:20,710 --> 00:05:22,270
But a gold mine,

79
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:25,190
for you,

80
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:28,630
would be a disaster.

81
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:30,070
Oh, please.

82
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,800
That's sheer nonsense.

83
00:05:31,950 --> 00:05:33,040
But what Mr. Song said before

84
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,480
all came true.

85
00:05:35,430 --> 00:05:36,310
Anyway,

86
00:05:36,900 --> 00:05:39,560
I wouldn't dare take on this mine
no matter what.

87
00:05:39,640 --> 00:05:40,500
How about this?

88
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:42,570
I'll take this mine

89
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,600
for now.

90
00:05:43,950 --> 00:05:45,159
No matter what,

91
00:05:45,630 --> 00:05:46,720
I'll refund

92
00:05:46,870 --> 00:05:49,270
your principal to you in full first.

93
00:05:52,290 --> 00:05:53,409
Thank you, Uncle.

94
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:38,360
Song Tiezui,

95
00:06:39,430 --> 00:06:40,830
Immortal Song,

96
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:43,070
you're truly divine.

97
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:44,390
President Chen,

98
00:06:44,390 --> 00:06:46,270
please don't make fun of me.

99
00:06:46,680 --> 00:06:48,390
In our line of work,

100
00:06:48,510 --> 00:06:51,490
we take people's money
to ward off disasters for them.

101
00:06:51,490 --> 00:06:52,880
I swear to the heavens

102
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:55,120
that helping you this time

103
00:06:55,200 --> 00:06:56,930
will cost me 10 years of my life.

104
00:06:59,390 --> 00:07:00,320
What do you mean?

105
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,000
I...

106
00:07:01,170 --> 00:07:03,330
You're okay with deceiving others

107
00:07:03,630 --> 00:07:04,870
for Hu Guangyuan,

108
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,360
but not for me?

109
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:07,480
No...

110
00:07:07,690 --> 00:07:08,860
Listen up.

111
00:07:08,890 --> 00:07:11,000
I saw right through you

112
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,720
the moment you took Hu Guangyuan's money

113
00:07:13,830 --> 00:07:16,490
and recommended the tin mine
to Lin Shengxiang.

114
00:07:16,520 --> 00:07:18,400
Only Lin Shengxiang is stupid enough

115
00:07:18,400 --> 00:07:20,130
to believe everything you say.

116
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,630
I did take Hu Guangyuan's money,

117
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:25,800
but from a feng shui perspective,

118
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,160
that mine is a treasure land.

119
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,430
I didn't lie,

120
00:07:28,870 --> 00:07:31,040
and gold was indeed found.

121
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,150
Rubbish!

122
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:36,310
You're just a blind cat
who found a dead mouse.

123
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:51,320
President Chen,

124
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,680
we agreed on 500 yuan.

125
00:07:53,750 --> 00:07:55,240
Why did it become 100 yuan?

126
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,190
What?

127
00:07:58,270 --> 00:07:59,390
You think 100 is too little?

128
00:07:59,390 --> 00:08:00,800
It's 400 short.

129
00:08:00,820 --> 00:08:01,340
Fine.

130
00:08:01,630 --> 00:08:04,070
Let's go talk to Lin Shengxiang together

131
00:08:04,310 --> 00:08:07,070
and see if he's willing to
give you another 500.

132
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,770
You're leaving?

133
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,500
I'm leaving tomorrow.

134
00:09:07,960 --> 00:09:08,960
So soon?

135
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:15,410
Back to Pujiang?

136
00:09:20,810 --> 00:09:21,720
San Francisco.

137
00:09:24,120 --> 00:09:24,870
That's far.

138
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,260
What about your business?

139
00:09:37,460 --> 00:09:38,670
Something's been

140
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:40,830
bugging me about

141
00:09:41,260 --> 00:09:42,120
that gold mine.

142
00:09:42,920 --> 00:09:44,520
Do you want to reconsider?

143
00:09:49,150 --> 00:09:52,030
There are other businesses
besides gold mining.

144
00:09:53,750 --> 00:09:55,120
We can open a factory.

145
00:09:56,010 --> 00:09:56,770
I heard...

146
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,400
I just don't want this matter

147
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:03,400
to cause a rift between
you and your father.

148
00:10:07,970 --> 00:10:08,850
I'm sorry.

149
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:12,670
As you know,

150
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,120
Daddy's a businessman.

151
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:19,950
Actually, he didn't really
cheat me out of anything.

152
00:10:20,750 --> 00:10:23,000
Look, I haven't lost a single cent.

153
00:10:24,630 --> 00:10:26,430
What about what you promised me?

154
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,000
Which is?

155
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,320
I'm still waiting...

156
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,770
for the ending of the story.

157
00:10:41,660 --> 00:10:42,260
Sorry.

158
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,330
I haven't finished writing it.

159
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,010
Lin Shengxiang,

160
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,720
are you really stupid

161
00:10:53,270 --> 00:10:54,600
or just playing dumb?

162
00:11:01,030 --> 00:11:02,750
At the bar where we first met,

163
00:11:04,240 --> 00:11:05,550
I left a gift for you.

164
00:11:08,030 --> 00:11:09,890
First thing tomorrow morning...

165
00:11:11,030 --> 00:11:12,290
remember to pick it up.

166
00:11:18,420 --> 00:11:24,810
[Chen's Mining Plant]

167
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,270
Any gold?

168
00:11:38,150 --> 00:11:39,440
Any gold?

169
00:11:39,870 --> 00:11:40,730
Any over there?

170
00:11:41,750 --> 00:11:42,840
Noticed any gold?

171
00:11:43,390 --> 00:11:45,120
Are these all stones?

172
00:11:45,320 --> 00:11:46,550
Where's my gold?

173
00:11:46,750 --> 00:11:47,670
Keep digging!

174
00:11:48,150 --> 00:11:49,480
Dig with all your might!

175
00:11:49,720 --> 00:11:51,720
I must see gold, even if we have to

176
00:11:51,720 --> 00:11:53,360
hollow out this mountain!

177
00:11:53,940 --> 00:11:54,490
Dig!

178
00:11:55,000 --> 00:11:55,960
Don't stop!

179
00:11:56,390 --> 00:11:58,460
Keep digging!

180
00:12:40,510 --> 00:12:41,600
Where's my gold?

181
00:12:41,620 --> 00:12:42,340
Mr. Chen,

182
00:12:42,710 --> 00:12:44,490
we've sifted 10 buckets in a row.

183
00:12:44,490 --> 00:12:45,450
It's all stones.

184
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:47,600
Not a single grain of gold was found.

185
00:12:52,460 --> 00:12:54,100
Mr. Chen!

186
00:12:59,250 --> 00:13:00,410
Search thoroughly!

187
00:13:00,870 --> 00:13:02,270
Don't let anyone escape!

188
00:13:02,320 --> 00:13:03,180
Director Zhao,

189
00:13:03,300 --> 00:13:05,180
I'll leave this matter to you.

190
00:13:05,240 --> 00:13:07,490
You must catch those three swindlers.

191
00:13:07,510 --> 00:13:09,230
I'll reward you handsomely.

192
00:13:09,510 --> 00:13:10,960
You're too kind, President Chen.

193
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:12,150
I've sent people to

194
00:13:12,170 --> 00:13:13,830
all the places you mentioned—

195
00:13:13,870 --> 00:13:15,000
Hu Guangyuan's house,

196
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,480
Song Bingzhang's fortune-telling parlor—

197
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:17,750
but there was no one there.

198
00:13:17,750 --> 00:13:19,350
Everything's been emptied out.

199
00:13:19,350 --> 00:13:21,350
If those three aren't caught,

200
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:25,240
I, Chen Jiarong, will become
the laughingstock of Pangzhou.

201
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:27,360
Don't worry. I'll deploy more men to

202
00:13:27,590 --> 00:13:29,870
keep a close watch on
all the stations and docks in the city.

203
00:13:29,870 --> 00:13:31,240
They can't escape.

204
00:13:33,170 --> 00:13:40,380
[Guanghe Warehouse]

205
00:13:36,550 --> 00:13:37,320
Get off.

206
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,200
Right here.

207
00:13:54,550 --> 00:13:56,600
Fine feathers make fine birds.

208
00:13:56,910 --> 00:13:58,200
Go pick out an outfit.

209
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,440
How is it, Senior?

210
00:14:00,500 --> 00:14:01,670
This photo's good.

211
00:14:01,960 --> 00:14:03,090
His eyes look great.

212
00:14:03,390 --> 00:14:05,120
You have to call him Master too.

213
00:14:05,230 --> 00:14:07,040
Song Bingzhang is my senior.

214
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:07,650
[Song Bingzhang of Tianxiang Sect]

215
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,760
Alright, time's up.

216
00:14:09,150 --> 00:14:10,870
Everyone, please go back.

217
00:14:11,270 --> 00:14:12,200
Song Tiezui,

218
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,630
Immortal Song,

219
00:14:13,910 --> 00:14:15,600
you're truly divine.

220
00:14:15,630 --> 00:14:17,030
I didn't lie.

221
00:14:19,240 --> 00:14:20,750
100,000 silver dollars

222
00:14:21,150 --> 00:14:22,610
all turned into gold bars.

223
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:25,010
We made a fortune this time.

224
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:26,000
Junior,

225
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:28,380
it's all thanks to your strategic vision

226
00:14:28,630 --> 00:14:30,160
and impeccable foresight.

227
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:33,690
Chen Jiarong is hunting us down
all over the city.

228
00:14:34,080 --> 00:14:36,680
Is this warehouse
we prepared in advance safe?

229
00:14:37,960 --> 00:14:39,440
I've arranged for the Chen family

230
00:14:39,440 --> 00:14:41,240
to head to the docks and stations.

231
00:14:41,240 --> 00:14:42,550
This place is remote.

232
00:14:42,630 --> 00:14:44,670
No one will think of coming here.

233
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:47,200
Do you think

234
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,600
that old fart would fall for it so easily,

235
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,720
believing there's gold in the mine?

236
00:14:52,360 --> 00:14:53,750
He's one of us.

237
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:54,670
[Zhu Wangfu of Tianxiang Sect]

238
00:14:54,720 --> 00:14:56,600
I thought of finding one of our own to

239
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:57,660
disguise as a miner

240
00:14:57,670 --> 00:14:59,800
and ask around at the Hu family's mine.

241
00:15:00,240 --> 00:15:02,040
You really think ahead, Master.

242
00:15:02,200 --> 00:15:03,330
I'm very impressed.

243
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,750
You did a decent job too.

244
00:15:05,150 --> 00:15:06,750
Come on. How much do I owe you?

245
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:10,000
100 silver dollars a day,

246
00:15:10,360 --> 00:15:11,560
for a total of 10 days.

247
00:15:11,790 --> 00:15:13,790
Plus a bonus of 1,000 silver dollars,

248
00:15:13,790 --> 00:15:14,630
that makes a total of

249
00:15:14,630 --> 00:15:15,890
2,000 silver dollars.

250
00:15:17,960 --> 00:15:18,550
Gui,

251
00:15:18,910 --> 00:15:19,710
give it to him.

252
00:15:21,510 --> 00:15:21,910
Here.

253
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,440
For you.

254
00:15:24,030 --> 00:15:24,630
Take it!

255
00:15:25,440 --> 00:15:26,000
Master,

256
00:15:26,750 --> 00:15:27,810
what's this about?

257
00:15:33,240 --> 00:15:33,970
Originally,

258
00:15:34,320 --> 00:15:35,790
we didn't have to kill you.

259
00:15:36,390 --> 00:15:39,030
But you've caused us trouble
time and again,

260
00:15:39,030 --> 00:15:40,490
always acting on your own.

261
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:43,030
Besides, you know too much.

262
00:15:43,240 --> 00:15:45,030
Keeping you alive is a threat.

263
00:15:45,060 --> 00:15:45,700
Am I right?

264
00:15:45,910 --> 00:15:46,480
Master,

265
00:15:47,080 --> 00:15:49,030
according to Tianxiang Sect's rules,

266
00:15:49,030 --> 00:15:50,490
killing fellow disciples

267
00:15:50,650 --> 00:15:51,850
is a capital offense.

268
00:15:55,320 --> 00:15:56,930
We are fellow disciples.

269
00:15:57,600 --> 00:15:58,600
You are not.

270
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,910
You're just a nobody.

271
00:16:13,600 --> 00:16:15,000
What are you laughing at?

272
00:16:15,080 --> 00:16:16,510
Before I left home today,

273
00:16:17,010 --> 00:16:18,410
I told my own fortune.

274
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:19,910
The hexagram said

275
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:21,570
I'm not destined to die today.

276
00:16:21,670 --> 00:16:23,200
Whoever tries to kill me

277
00:16:23,830 --> 00:16:25,080
will also end up dead.

278
00:16:25,910 --> 00:16:27,670
You can even tell fortunes?

279
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,630
Then let's see how accurate

280
00:16:29,630 --> 00:16:31,390
your fortune-telling is.

281
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:32,010
Alright,

282
00:16:32,150 --> 00:16:33,150
enough nonsense.

283
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:33,600
Gui.

284
00:16:36,670 --> 00:16:37,510
You

285
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:41,000
are just a big idiot!

286
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:55,000
Freeze!

287
00:16:55,190 --> 00:16:57,320
Things are getting tense! Let's bail!

288
00:17:09,550 --> 00:17:10,109
Freeze!

289
00:17:10,270 --> 00:17:11,000
Freeze!

290
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:13,000
Freeze!

291
00:17:19,160 --> 00:17:20,510
Freeze!

292
00:17:22,700 --> 00:17:23,700
Don't shoot!

293
00:17:24,810 --> 00:17:26,410
Freeze!

294
00:17:44,680 --> 00:17:46,350
At the bar where we first met,

295
00:17:47,030 --> 00:17:48,240
I left a gift for you.

296
00:17:49,030 --> 00:17:50,500
First thing tomorrow morning,

297
00:17:50,500 --> 00:17:51,680
remember to pick it up.

298
00:17:51,680 --> 00:17:52,350
Miss Chen.

299
00:17:53,440 --> 00:17:54,040
Miss Chen?

300
00:17:55,070 --> 00:17:57,070
Mr. Lin asked me to give this to you.

301
00:18:04,420 --> 00:18:05,910
[Chen Qingying]

302
00:18:09,830 --> 00:18:11,830
[Target Profile]

303
00:18:19,200 --> 00:18:19,880
Hello.

304
00:18:20,440 --> 00:18:22,110
I was hired for 100 silver dollars a day

305
00:18:22,110 --> 00:18:23,400
to win you over.

306
00:18:23,830 --> 00:18:26,200
I've never heard this pickup line before.

307
00:18:26,550 --> 00:18:27,280
I'm serious.

308
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:29,050
And I agreed to it.

309
00:18:29,720 --> 00:18:31,350
You're quite interesting.

310
00:18:31,960 --> 00:18:33,690
Saving the damsel in distress?

311
00:18:34,110 --> 00:18:34,960
So cliché.

312
00:18:35,550 --> 00:18:36,590
It is a bit cliché.

313
00:18:37,440 --> 00:18:38,310
But...

314
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:42,330
there are always fools who fall for it.

315
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:55,750
[East Suburb Warehouse 405]

316
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:03,400
Wait.

317
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:04,790
Officer.

318
00:19:05,270 --> 00:19:06,800
I have something to report.

319
00:19:07,030 --> 00:19:08,110
Why isn't he arrested?

320
00:19:08,110 --> 00:19:08,960
He's a fraud too.

321
00:19:08,960 --> 00:19:10,090
We're accomplices.

322
00:19:10,350 --> 00:19:12,350
His real name isn't Lin Shengxiang.

323
00:19:12,510 --> 00:19:13,440
It's Lyu Ruhui.

324
00:19:13,510 --> 00:19:15,110
I brought him back from Pujiang.

325
00:19:15,110 --> 00:19:16,270
In this situation,

326
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:18,740
you're still trying to frame Mr. Lin.

327
00:19:19,270 --> 00:19:21,930
You really won't quit
until the bitter end, huh?

328
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,530
Take a good look at this.

329
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:25,750
His passport and ID document

330
00:19:25,750 --> 00:19:27,480
were found at the hotel.

331
00:19:27,920 --> 00:19:29,050
It's been verified.

332
00:19:29,590 --> 00:19:31,050
There's no doubt about it!

333
00:19:34,720 --> 00:19:36,270
I hunted eagles all my life,

334
00:19:36,830 --> 00:19:39,560
only to have my eyes pecked out
by a house sparrow.

335
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:40,960
Young fellow,

336
00:19:41,640 --> 00:19:42,590
you're good.

337
00:19:43,830 --> 00:19:44,690
Take them away!

338
00:19:55,510 --> 00:19:56,370
Director Zhao.

339
00:20:04,190 --> 00:20:05,190
Gentlemen,

340
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:06,060
look here.

341
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:38,140
Those two ID documents

342
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:39,880
are fake.

343
00:20:42,310 --> 00:20:43,480
Who on earth are you?

344
00:20:48,240 --> 00:20:49,840
Since you know they're fake,

345
00:20:51,720 --> 00:20:53,450
why did you save a fraud like me?

346
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:00,530
What did you cheat me out of?

347
00:21:02,160 --> 00:21:02,750
My money,

348
00:21:04,510 --> 00:21:05,070
my body,

349
00:21:05,590 --> 00:21:06,590
or my feelings?

350
00:21:10,720 --> 00:21:12,270
Don't be fooled again.

351
00:21:14,510 --> 00:21:15,880
You're luckier than me.

352
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:19,930
At least you didn't lose anything.

353
00:21:20,110 --> 00:21:21,960
I want to know how the story ends.

354
00:21:24,040 --> 00:21:25,230
The real ending.

355
00:21:29,530 --> 00:21:30,240
Fine.

356
00:21:34,110 --> 00:21:35,560
I'll tell you now.

357
00:21:40,050 --> 00:21:43,880
[Eight years ago]

358
00:21:43,510 --> 00:21:45,070
Mr. Du, Mr. Du,

359
00:21:45,680 --> 00:21:47,000
here's 20,000 silver dollars.

360
00:21:47,000 --> 00:21:48,750
I've wiped out my entire life savings.

361
00:21:48,750 --> 00:21:50,350
Please save my brother and sister.

362
00:21:50,350 --> 00:21:51,640
I've already told you

363
00:21:52,270 --> 00:21:54,030
that the money isn't for me.

364
00:21:54,310 --> 00:21:56,170
It's for you to rebuild the temple

365
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:58,070
and worship the Immortal Elder.

366
00:21:59,920 --> 00:22:00,720
I understand.

367
00:22:01,270 --> 00:22:02,070
I understand.

368
00:22:02,960 --> 00:22:04,240
Please take action as soon as possible.

369
00:22:04,240 --> 00:22:05,960
Being in seclusion for 7 days,

370
00:22:05,980 --> 00:22:08,620
I've heard some divine whisper
in the mist.

371
00:22:09,070 --> 00:22:10,930
But I still have to ask the founder

372
00:22:10,940 --> 00:22:13,660
if I can tell you this information.

373
00:22:27,910 --> 00:22:29,510
Come forward and take a look.

374
00:22:35,510 --> 00:22:36,970
A moonlit night on the 15th

375
00:22:37,350 --> 00:22:38,510
by the Nanxi River,

376
00:22:39,160 --> 00:22:40,960
the immortal children descend.

377
00:22:40,960 --> 00:22:42,290
Against the current...

378
00:22:43,110 --> 00:22:44,440
Against the current...

379
00:22:44,510 --> 00:22:46,640
I can't see the last few words clearly.

380
00:22:47,110 --> 00:22:48,640
A moonlit night on the 15th?

381
00:22:49,160 --> 00:22:50,290
Isn't that tonight?

382
00:22:53,510 --> 00:22:55,710
Since the founder answered the prayer,

383
00:22:56,160 --> 00:22:57,240
go to Nanxi River

384
00:22:57,590 --> 00:22:58,920
at midnight tonight,

385
00:22:59,310 --> 00:23:01,510
and you'll see your brother and sister.

386
00:23:04,680 --> 00:23:06,310
