390
00:23:12,310 --> 00:23:13,640
The river's flowing backwards,

391
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:16,070
and the corpses are drifting
from downstream to upstream.

392
00:23:16,070 --> 00:23:18,000
I've never seen
such a spooky thing before.

393
00:23:18,000 --> 00:23:19,310
Mr. Du said it's the sins

394
00:23:19,310 --> 00:23:20,550
committed by the Wangs...

395
00:23:20,550 --> 00:23:21,160
Jialiang!

396
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:22,480
That angered the Immortal Elder.

397
00:23:22,480 --> 00:23:23,000
Jiashu!

398
00:23:23,000 --> 00:23:24,240
We'd better pool our money quickly

399
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:25,550
to repair the Immortal Temple.

400
00:23:25,550 --> 00:23:26,550
Mr. Du said that

401
00:23:26,570 --> 00:23:28,100
restoring the gold-leaf statue
is the only way

402
00:23:28,100 --> 00:23:29,240
to appease Immortal Elder's anger.

403
00:23:29,240 --> 00:23:29,840
Jialiang!

404
00:23:30,550 --> 00:23:31,240
Jiashu!

405
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:32,270
Jialiang!

406
00:23:32,790 --> 00:23:33,480
Jiashu!

407
00:23:35,070 --> 00:23:38,200
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

408
00:23:38,200 --> 00:23:41,350
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

409
00:23:41,350 --> 00:23:44,640
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

