00:23:51,200 --> 00:23:55,060
The immortal children descend.
Against the current, the corpses go.

413
00:23:56,400 --> 00:23:57,200
Jialiang!

414
00:23:57,750 --> 00:23:58,480
Jiashu!

415
00:24:11,480 --> 00:24:12,270
Jialiang!

416
00:24:12,640 --> 00:24:13,370
Jiashu!

417
00:25:39,000 --> 00:25:39,600
Jialiang.

418
00:25:41,510 --> 00:25:42,200
Jiashu.

419
00:25:45,480 --> 00:25:46,310
Wang Jiaxian!

420
00:25:46,550 --> 00:25:47,810
Your lack of reverence

421
00:25:47,880 --> 00:25:49,070
enraged Immortal Elder!

422
00:25:49,070 --> 00:25:51,310
Now the whole town has to live in fear!

423
00:25:51,480 --> 00:25:52,240
Get out!

424
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:53,160
Get out now!

425
00:25:53,350 --> 00:25:54,920
Get out, you jinx!

426
00:25:54,920 --> 00:25:56,850
Immortal Elder wants
the lives of you Wangs!

427
00:25:56,850 --> 00:25:58,850
We're innocent! Don't drag us down!

428
00:25:59,240 --> 00:26:00,160
Get out!

429
00:26:03,440 --> 00:26:05,750
Your brother and sister
died in your place!

430
00:26:05,750 --> 00:26:09,200
The corpses floating upstream is
Immortal Elder manifesting to take lives!

431
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,790
You're next!

432
00:26:10,880 --> 00:26:11,920
Get out now!

433
00:26:38,310 --> 00:26:39,030
Feiyan.

434
00:26:40,750 --> 00:26:41,480
Feiyan!

435
00:26:43,240 --> 00:26:44,350
Feiyan!

436
00:26:45,550 --> 00:26:46,640
Feiyan!

437
00:26:47,720 --> 00:26:48,590
Feiyan?

438
00:26:59,830 --> 00:27:00,590
Stepmother.

439
00:27:08,350 --> 00:27:09,080
Stepmother.

440
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:13,960
Stepmother.

441
00:27:21,960 --> 00:27:22,830
Jiaxian.

442
00:27:26,590 --> 00:27:27,400
Jialiang...

443
00:27:29,110 --> 00:27:30,160
and Jiashu...

444
00:27:33,960 --> 00:27:36,510
are dead!

445
00:27:36,650 --> 00:27:37,480
Stepmother!

446
00:27:50,510 --> 00:27:51,350
Stepmother.

447
00:27:57,350 --> 00:27:57,950
Talisman.

448
00:27:59,470 --> 00:28:00,040
Talisman.

449
00:28:00,040 --> 00:28:00,770
Stepmother.

450
00:28:05,090 --> 00:28:05,680
Stepmother!

451
00:28:05,680 --> 00:28:07,200
What are you doing?

452
00:28:10,590 --> 00:28:11,480
Jiaxian.

453
00:28:13,270 --> 00:28:14,160
It was me...

454
00:28:16,030 --> 00:28:17,510
who killed your father.

455
00:28:18,270 --> 00:28:19,030
Stepmother.

456
00:28:20,830 --> 00:28:22,360
What are you talking about?

457
00:28:22,370 --> 00:28:24,760
That blind man Du made me do it.

458
00:28:25,440 --> 00:28:27,480
He gave me all these talismans.

459
00:28:27,960 --> 00:28:29,110
He told me

460
00:28:29,640 --> 00:28:31,350
to burn them to ashes

461
00:28:31,680 --> 00:28:33,810
and secretly feed them to your father.

462
00:28:46,640 --> 00:28:47,500
Stepmother...

463
00:28:49,280 --> 00:28:50,610
Are you out of your mind?

464
00:28:50,680 --> 00:28:52,240
Only by doing this

465
00:28:54,030 --> 00:28:56,240
would your father love me and only me.

466
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:57,650
All these years,

467
00:28:58,400 --> 00:29:00,330
had my father not treated you well?

468
00:29:01,750 --> 00:29:02,610
Your father...

469
00:29:05,240 --> 00:29:06,830
did treat me very well.

470
00:29:10,110 --> 00:29:12,310
You also treated me like your own mother

471
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:15,460
and doted on your brother and sister.

472
00:29:16,080 --> 00:29:18,750
I've been married into the Wang family
for so many years,

473
00:29:18,750 --> 00:29:20,550
had two children,

474
00:29:21,070 --> 00:29:22,920
managed the household,

475
00:29:23,510 --> 00:29:25,480
and raised you three.

476
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:27,400
But I've always...

477
00:29:30,000 --> 00:29:31,790
remained an outsider.

478
00:29:32,400 --> 00:29:33,200
Stepmother!

479
00:29:34,920 --> 00:29:36,200
What are you saying?

480
00:29:37,880 --> 00:29:39,810
Your father thought I didn't know.

481
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:42,960
He only married me

482
00:29:45,670 --> 00:29:47,910
because I look like your mother.

483
00:29:48,630 --> 00:29:49,500
Your mother

484
00:29:50,260 --> 00:29:51,870
has been dead for 20 years.

485
00:29:52,300 --> 00:29:53,950
But in this house...

486
00:29:56,950 --> 00:29:58,830
I'm just her replacement...

487
00:30:00,700 --> 00:30:02,220
her shadow.

488
00:30:06,350 --> 00:30:07,430
Do you know that

489
00:30:09,350 --> 00:30:10,880
when your father got drunk,

490
00:30:13,110 --> 00:30:15,670
he only called your mother's name?

491
00:30:16,700 --> 00:30:18,110
I'm a woman.

492
00:30:19,190 --> 00:30:20,910
I have no other desires.

493
00:30:21,430 --> 00:30:23,690
I just wanted your father to love only me,

494
00:30:23,740 --> 00:30:26,150
to stop seeing me as just a replacement!

495
00:30:26,300 --> 00:30:27,830
Is it wrong of me to have just this

496
00:30:27,830 --> 00:30:29,350
one little selfish wish?

497
00:30:30,220 --> 00:30:32,260
I didn't expect that

498
00:30:33,060 --> 00:30:35,190
this tiny bit of selfishness...

499
00:30:37,220 --> 00:30:39,280
would result in your father's death.

500
00:30:41,780 --> 00:30:42,700
Your father

501
00:30:43,110 --> 00:30:44,700
hated my guts.

502
00:30:46,780 --> 00:30:47,500
So,

503
00:30:49,260 --> 00:30:51,430
he took Jialiang and Jiashu away.

504
00:30:52,630 --> 00:30:54,700
He's punishing me.

505
00:30:55,780 --> 00:30:56,700
Stepmother,

506
00:30:57,110 --> 00:30:58,700
please come to your senses.

507
00:31:00,910 --> 00:31:03,300
I didn't take good care of this family.

508
00:31:04,220 --> 00:31:06,220
I let the Wang family down.

509
00:31:10,980 --> 00:31:13,220
I also let your father down.

510
00:31:14,950 --> 00:31:15,910
Your mother too.

511
00:31:17,430 --> 00:31:18,960
When I get to the other side,

512
00:31:19,670 --> 00:31:20,670
I will

513
00:31:21,300 --> 00:31:22,390
kowtow to them

514
00:31:23,110 --> 00:31:24,390
and apologize.

515
00:31:24,910 --> 00:31:25,640
Stepmother.

516
00:31:26,500 --> 00:31:27,230
Stepmother.

517
00:31:27,670 --> 00:31:28,400
Stepmother.

518
00:31:29,260 --> 00:31:29,990
Stepmother.

519
00:31:30,870 --> 00:31:31,600
Stepmother.

520
00:31:39,300 --> 00:31:40,630
That wife of yours

521
00:31:42,060 --> 00:31:43,590
isn't coming back.

522
00:31:45,830 --> 00:31:47,260
By the river,

523
00:31:48,300 --> 00:31:50,390
I saw her walking away...

524
00:31:52,430 --> 00:31:53,390
alone.

525
00:32:07,090 --> 00:32:13,670
♪ Under the old city wall,
that year the rain fell gently ♪

526
00:32:08,670 --> 00:32:10,910
This story is very tragic.

527
00:32:12,220 --> 00:32:13,750
But it's not over yet, is it?

528
00:32:14,240 --> 00:32:20,200
♪ You walked by with an umbrella,
saying loneliness didn't scare you ♪

529
00:32:16,460 --> 00:32:17,430
I don't know.

530
00:32:20,220 --> 00:32:21,630
Maybe it's already over.

531
00:32:21,270 --> 00:32:27,580
♪ Later, a blade lay hidden
within a smile ♪

532
00:32:24,590 --> 00:32:26,350
Maybe it's just begun.

533
00:32:28,830 --> 00:32:36,080
♪ An impulsive, spiteful remark
cut deep into my heart ♪

534
00:32:36,490 --> 00:32:42,110
♪ You know full well how weak I am ♪

535
00:32:37,670 --> 00:32:38,430
Shengxiang,

536
00:32:39,430 --> 00:32:41,020
I know this story

537
00:32:42,640 --> 00:32:44,820
♪ Yet you always turn around ♪

538
00:32:43,060 --> 00:32:44,300
doesn't belong to me.

539
00:32:44,850 --> 00:32:50,640
♪ Shielding me from
harsh words and cold daggers ♪

540
00:32:45,460 --> 00:32:47,220
But the scenery I saw with you

541
00:32:47,910 --> 00:32:49,950
while listening to it...

542
00:32:51,780 --> 00:32:55,230
♪ May you journey toward your future ♪

543
00:32:52,950 --> 00:32:54,430
I will always remember.

544
00:32:55,290 --> 00:32:58,190
♪ Leave this stormy sea behind ♪

545
00:32:58,840 --> 00:33:02,350
♪ Let the toxic love we shared ♪

546
00:33:02,370 --> 00:33:04,940
♪ Be the moss that helps you grow ♪

547
00:33:05,740 --> 00:33:09,290
♪ May you find your way out
of the haze that is us ♪

548
00:33:09,320 --> 00:33:12,010
♪ Leave me out of your story ♪

549
00:33:12,790 --> 00:33:16,180
♪ Should freedom be your ultimate desire ♪

550
00:33:15,590 --> 00:33:16,390
I will, too.

551
00:33:16,250 --> 00:33:21,160
♪ I shall bloom for you in silence ♪

552
00:33:37,910 --> 00:33:39,260
I spent some money

553
00:33:39,870 --> 00:33:41,400
to buy those two scoundrels

554
00:33:41,500 --> 00:33:43,910
back from Director Zhao.

555
00:33:44,740 --> 00:33:45,430
Fraud will

556
00:33:46,110 --> 00:33:48,150
get them three years at most.

557
00:33:48,630 --> 00:33:51,230
I'm not letting two bastards
get off that easy.

558
00:33:52,110 --> 00:33:52,950
I see.

559
00:33:55,220 --> 00:33:56,350
But you know what?

560
00:33:57,060 --> 00:33:58,460
The one I hate the most...

561
00:34:01,590 --> 00:34:03,150
is actually you.

562
00:34:04,460 --> 00:34:06,500
If Qingying hadn't pleaded for you,

563
00:34:07,190 --> 00:34:09,659
you'd be down there right now too.

564
00:34:15,750 --> 00:34:17,949
After going around in such a big circle,

565
00:34:18,310 --> 00:34:20,830
my money is still my money,

566
00:34:21,060 --> 00:34:24,620
and the four swindlers
are still four swindlers.

567
00:34:24,980 --> 00:34:26,270
What are you after?

568
00:34:32,610 --> 00:34:34,489
It's them you're after.

569
00:34:35,270 --> 00:34:36,330
You could say that.

570
00:34:38,429 --> 00:34:39,580
Even so,

571
00:34:39,659 --> 00:34:41,350
you shouldn't have lied to me,

572
00:34:41,350 --> 00:34:43,350
let alone deceive Qingying!

573
00:34:43,380 --> 00:34:45,050
You scumbag!

574
00:34:48,659 --> 00:34:50,260
Qingying's a good woman.

575
00:34:50,980 --> 00:34:52,060
I let her down.

576
00:34:57,210 --> 00:34:58,610
But you being scammed...

577
00:35:02,620 --> 00:35:03,660
You deserved it.

578
00:35:06,230 --> 00:35:07,950
If I'm not mistaken,

579
00:35:09,180 --> 00:35:11,350
when Qingying first approached me,

580
00:35:11,710 --> 00:35:14,660
you were pulling the strings
behind the scenes, right?

581
00:35:14,660 --> 00:35:15,790
After that,

582
00:35:15,910 --> 00:35:17,500
you were the one playing both sides,

583
00:35:17,500 --> 00:35:19,910
and you were the one who
wanted the gold mine to yourself.

584
00:35:19,910 --> 00:35:21,540
If you hadn't been greedy,

585
00:35:22,710 --> 00:35:24,390
who could've scammed

586
00:35:25,950 --> 00:35:27,500
a single penny from you?

587
00:35:36,500 --> 00:35:37,980
You're not the first scammer

588
00:35:37,980 --> 00:35:39,350
I've met.

589
00:35:39,750 --> 00:35:41,140
But a scammer

590
00:35:41,910 --> 00:35:44,980
so self-righteous is really a first.

591
00:35:45,180 --> 00:35:47,230
But I've seen plenty of

592
00:35:48,620 --> 00:35:50,430
hypocrites like you.

593
00:35:56,790 --> 00:35:57,950
Whatever.

594
00:35:59,660 --> 00:36:00,830
Whatever.

595
00:36:16,620 --> 00:36:17,980
What are you doing here?

596
00:36:20,460 --> 00:36:22,320
I'm here to ask you about someone.

597
00:36:23,620 --> 00:36:24,790
Who?

598
00:36:25,500 --> 00:36:26,540
He's surnamed Du,

599
00:36:27,540 --> 00:36:28,740
in his early fifties,

600
00:36:29,270 --> 00:36:30,540
and he's blind.

601
00:36:32,420 --> 00:36:34,100
Who exactly are you?

602
00:36:35,500 --> 00:36:37,270
I'm the one asking questions.

603
00:36:37,660 --> 00:36:39,870
You just have to answer me.

604
00:36:40,230 --> 00:36:40,830
Then...

605
00:36:41,230 --> 00:36:42,230
Don't say a thing.

606
00:36:42,790 --> 00:36:44,660
If... If I tell you,

607
00:36:44,980 --> 00:36:46,710
what's in it for us?

608
00:36:47,310 --> 00:36:48,950
That old fart Chen Jiarong

609
00:36:48,980 --> 00:36:50,350
gave me this authority:

610
00:36:50,980 --> 00:36:52,750
whoever answers my question,

611
00:36:53,310 --> 00:36:54,870
I'll let him go.

612
00:36:55,980 --> 00:36:56,870
But

613
00:36:57,460 --> 00:36:58,990
I can only let one person go.

614
00:36:59,180 --> 00:37:01,140
Don't believe him, Senior.

615
00:37:01,140 --> 00:37:02,540
Don't say anything.

616
00:37:04,640 --> 00:37:06,040
Neither of you will talk?

617
00:37:08,230 --> 00:37:09,350
Then

618
00:37:10,230 --> 00:37:11,560
you'll both have to die.

619
00:37:17,830 --> 00:37:18,540
Goodbye.

620
00:37:22,230 --> 00:37:24,130
Can you give us some water to drink?

621
00:37:24,130 --> 00:37:25,620
The person you're looking for

622
00:37:25,620 --> 00:37:26,500
is Du Binghui!

623
00:37:26,500 --> 00:37:27,790
Shut up!

624
00:37:27,790 --> 00:37:29,020
Junior, this is unbearable.

625
00:37:29,020 --> 00:37:29,910
Song Bingzhang!

626
00:37:29,910 --> 00:37:30,620
Don't speak!

627
00:37:30,620 --> 00:37:30,950
Shut up!

628
00:37:30,950 --> 00:37:32,140
He's my master!

629
00:37:32,140 --> 00:37:34,470
He's the grandmaster of Longxuya Branch!

630
00:37:34,620 --> 00:37:36,350
He's currently in Qianshan.

631
00:37:36,500 --> 00:37:37,540
I'm his eldest disciple.

632
00:37:37,540 --> 00:37:38,980
He trusts me the most!

633
00:37:38,980 --> 00:37:40,140
Take me out of here,

634
00:37:40,140 --> 00:37:41,660
and I'll help you kill him!

635
00:37:41,660 --> 00:37:42,910
Song Bingzhang!

636
00:37:43,100 --> 00:37:44,460
Use your brain!

637
00:37:44,710 --> 00:37:46,910
The one we offended is Chen Jiarong.

638
00:37:46,980 --> 00:37:48,180
Our lives

639
00:37:48,230 --> 00:37:49,790
are not up to him!

640
00:37:50,910 --> 00:37:52,180
He's right.

641
00:37:52,980 --> 00:37:54,230
Your lives

642
00:37:54,500 --> 00:37:56,460
are indeed not up to me.

643
00:37:57,790 --> 00:37:58,620
Goodbye!

644
00:37:59,870 --> 00:38:00,980
Come back!

645
00:38:01,460 --> 00:38:02,910
You dirty liar!

646
00:38:02,930 --> 00:38:04,210
Oh, my lord!

647
00:38:10,660 --> 00:38:12,980
Don't show up in Qingying's life
ever again.

648
00:38:12,980 --> 00:38:15,230
Come back here!

649
00:38:15,750 --> 00:38:17,790
You dirty liar!

650
00:38:34,950 --> 00:38:36,230
Turn on the machine.

651
00:38:46,140 --> 00:38:47,670
Send these two fine fellows

652
00:38:47,870 --> 00:38:48,830
on their way.

653
00:38:51,870 --> 00:38:53,390
H-Help!

654
00:38:54,180 --> 00:38:56,050
Help!

655
00:38:56,460 --> 00:38:57,100
Spare me!

656
00:38:57,100 --> 00:38:59,390
I don't want to die!

657
00:39:10,950 --> 00:39:12,210
How's his health been?

658
00:39:12,580 --> 00:39:13,470
He's much better.

659
00:39:13,470 --> 00:39:16,530
Lately, I've been asking him
to take a walk after meals.

660
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:18,740
Mr. Jin is waiting for you inside.

661
00:39:41,060 --> 00:39:41,910
Mentor.

662
00:39:54,060 --> 00:39:55,700
Looking at your mother's fate blueprint,

663
00:39:55,700 --> 00:39:58,410
I'm afraid she won't survive this time.

664
00:39:58,900 --> 00:40:00,860
Master, I beg you.

665
00:40:00,950 --> 00:40:01,950
Please save my mother.

666
00:40:01,950 --> 00:40:03,390
If you don't help me,

667
00:40:03,390 --> 00:40:05,140
my mother will die!

668
00:40:05,900 --> 00:40:07,490
Master, please help him.

669
00:40:07,620 --> 00:40:10,060
Please help him.

670
00:40:10,460 --> 00:40:12,390
If you believe him...

671
00:40:14,710 --> 00:40:16,660
your mother will really die.

672
00:40:17,140 --> 00:40:18,870
Do you have a grudge against me?

673
00:40:19,020 --> 00:40:21,020
Why target a fortune teller like me?

674
00:40:29,980 --> 00:40:31,910
I have no grudge against you.

675
00:40:34,540 --> 00:40:35,870
But I know...

676
00:40:37,870 --> 00:40:40,460
you fortune-telling bastards

677
00:40:41,100 --> 00:40:42,270
are all frauds!

678
00:40:44,620 --> 00:40:45,980
You've gone too far!

679
00:40:45,980 --> 00:40:47,140
I'll fight you!

680
00:40:47,140 --> 00:40:48,540
He's bullying an old man!

681
00:40:48,540 --> 00:40:49,020
Sir.

682
00:40:49,140 --> 00:40:50,060
Sir, are you okay?

683
00:40:50,060 --> 00:40:51,460
What are you waiting for?

684
00:40:51,500 --> 00:40:52,230
Get him!

685
00:40:56,430 --> 00:40:57,270
Hit him hard!

686
00:41:09,390 --> 00:41:10,460
Wallop him!

687
00:41:10,540 --> 00:41:11,430
Hit him hard!

688
00:41:23,600 --> 00:41:24,530
We're done here!

689
00:42:35,460 --> 00:42:37,710
This ruined temple is quite eerie.

690
00:42:40,230 --> 00:42:41,180
Come down.

691
00:42:42,660 --> 00:42:43,540
Let's chat.

692
00:42:55,620 --> 00:42:57,100
Your facial features indicate

693
00:42:57,100 --> 00:42:58,900
you have a long life ahead of you.

694
00:42:58,910 --> 00:43:00,040
You won't die today.

695
00:43:00,390 --> 00:43:01,720
Come down and talk to me.

696
00:43:03,460 --> 00:43:04,870
You think? Watch me die

697
00:43:06,500 --> 00:43:08,300
right in front of you today then.

698
00:43:44,270 --> 00:43:44,830
Come on.

699
00:43:45,890 --> 00:43:46,950
Warm up by the fire.

700
00:43:54,980 --> 00:43:56,780
You clearly have no experience.

701
00:43:57,870 --> 00:43:59,060
How could such a thin rope

702
00:43:59,060 --> 00:43:59,920
hold the weight

703
00:44:00,060 --> 00:44:01,430
of a grown man like you?

704
00:44:08,270 --> 00:44:09,100
What?

705
00:44:11,530 --> 00:44:13,390
Have you hanged yourself before?

706
00:44:14,620 --> 00:44:16,430
In these chaotic times,

707
00:44:17,140 --> 00:44:19,660
who hasn't seen a few folks
hang themselves?

708
00:44:24,430 --> 00:44:25,870
Why is it that you want to

709
00:44:25,980 --> 00:44:27,390
end it all?

710
00:44:29,300 --> 00:44:30,900
Aren't you a fortune teller?

711
00:44:32,660 --> 00:44:33,620
Take a guess.

712
00:44:37,790 --> 00:44:39,180
What else could it be?

713
00:44:39,580 --> 00:44:40,980
Loved ones passing away,

714
00:44:41,910 --> 00:44:43,540
one's family falling from grace,

715
00:44:43,540 --> 00:44:45,000
losing people and assets,

716
00:44:45,870 --> 00:44:47,230
or a broken romance.

717
00:44:47,750 --> 00:44:49,140
Life inevitably boils down

718
00:44:49,140 --> 00:44:50,310
to these few things.

719
00:44:56,460 --> 00:44:57,310
Old man...

720
00:45:01,500 --> 00:45:02,760
do you believe in fate?

721
00:45:03,350 --> 00:45:04,310
Of course I do.

722
00:45:07,910 --> 00:45:08,870
Then tell me:

723
00:45:11,750 --> 00:45:14,480
what sins could a person commit
in their past life

724
00:45:16,270 --> 00:45:18,000
to simultaneously experience

725
00:45:19,660 --> 00:45:21,260
his loved ones passing away,

726
00:45:22,950 --> 00:45:24,680
his family falling from grace,

727
00:45:25,980 --> 00:45:27,440
losing people and assets,

728
00:45:30,020 --> 00:45:31,830
and a broken romance?

729
00:45:37,430 --> 00:45:39,950
It seems you're determined to die.

730
00:45:41,460 --> 00:45:43,660
I've been wandering the world for years

731
00:45:43,870 --> 00:45:45,930
and heard many stories of the living.

732
00:45:45,980 --> 00:45:47,640
But the stories of the dead...

733
00:45:49,100 --> 00:45:50,500
I've really never heard.

734
00:45:53,350 --> 00:45:54,280
Tell me about it.

735
00:46:07,660 --> 00:46:09,830
You've been set up.

736
00:46:11,830 --> 00:46:12,620
Set up?

737
00:46:13,660 --> 00:46:15,580
There are many swindlers out there,

738
00:46:15,580 --> 00:46:18,180
but judging from your experience,

739
00:46:19,830 --> 00:46:21,230
it should be

740
00:46:21,970 --> 00:46:24,490
the work of Tianxiang Sect.

741
00:46:27,620 --> 00:46:28,620
Tianxiang Sect?

742
00:46:30,750 --> 00:46:31,480
What is that?

743
00:46:32,350 --> 00:46:33,830
The Tianxiang Sect

744
00:46:33,950 --> 00:46:35,660
is a band of con artists

745
00:46:35,830 --> 00:46:37,460
who use fortune-telling

746
00:46:37,620 --> 00:46:38,750
as a front.

747
00:46:39,020 --> 00:46:41,180
From the moment you met Jiang Feiyan,

748
00:46:41,980 --> 00:46:44,060
you'd already fallen into their trap.

749
00:46:44,060 --> 00:46:45,460
But Jiang Feiyan's an opera singer.

750
00:46:45,460 --> 00:46:47,190
She has nothing to do with this.

751
00:46:47,350 --> 00:46:49,390
The Tianxiang Sect has many members,

752
00:46:49,390 --> 00:46:51,180
and one of their branches is all female.

753
00:46:51,180 --> 00:46:52,620
They don't tell fortunes,

754
00:46:52,620 --> 00:46:55,310
but they use their looks to seduce men

755
00:46:55,310 --> 00:46:56,750
to fleece them.

756
00:46:59,750 --> 00:47:02,210
How do you know so much
about Tianxiang Sect?

757
00:47:08,620 --> 00:47:11,140
I used to be in Tianxiang Sect.

758
00:47:18,390 --> 00:47:20,270
You...

759
00:47:36,540 --> 00:47:37,430
Look,

760
00:47:38,460 --> 00:47:40,640
I have the Tianxiang Sect to thank

761
00:47:41,180 --> 00:47:43,180
for this lame leg.

762
00:47:43,870 --> 00:47:45,580
I slaved away for them,

763
00:47:45,830 --> 00:47:48,180
only to be backstabbed.

764
00:47:49,140 --> 00:47:51,180
Now I've ended up like this.

765
00:47:51,950 --> 00:47:53,350
At my worst,

766
00:47:54,180 --> 00:47:55,460
I was only a breath away

767
00:47:56,140 --> 00:47:57,460
from death.

768
00:47:58,270 --> 00:48:00,000
The only thing keeping me alive

769
00:48:00,230 --> 00:48:01,390
is one thought:

770
00:48:03,460 --> 00:48:04,860
destroy Tianxiang Sect.

771
00:48:09,870 --> 00:48:11,270
Destroy Tianxiang Sect?

772
00:48:12,350 --> 00:48:13,880
With that lame leg of yours,

773
00:48:15,390 --> 00:48:16,790
how can you destroy them?

774
00:48:22,660 --> 00:48:25,320
Physical strength isn't needed
for my revenge.

775
00:48:29,620 --> 00:48:32,140
I know all the tricks of Tianxiang Sect.

776
00:48:32,200 --> 00:48:34,680
They're nothing but charlatans
putting on a supernatural show

777
00:48:34,680 --> 00:48:35,950
to delude people.

778
00:48:36,310 --> 00:48:37,180
Then how did

779
00:48:38,310 --> 00:48:39,910
the Immortal Elder recruit

780
00:48:40,580 --> 00:48:41,840
the child attendants?

781
00:48:46,350 --> 00:48:48,350
Saving countless souls!

782
00:48:49,580 --> 00:48:51,580
The child attendants you saw

783
00:48:51,870 --> 00:48:53,470
must've been living people.

784
00:48:54,350 --> 00:48:56,010
They were alive when they were

785
00:48:56,710 --> 00:48:58,170
sealed into clay statues.

786
00:49:00,580 --> 00:49:02,350
They couldn't speak or move,

787
00:49:03,020 --> 00:49:04,620
and would die

788
00:49:04,620 --> 00:49:05,870
in a few days.

789
00:49:06,830 --> 00:49:07,580
Then...

790
00:49:08,910 --> 00:49:10,300
how did the words materialize

791
00:49:10,300 --> 00:49:13,160
in the incense ash,
becoming a prophecy fulfilled?

792
00:49:13,910 --> 00:49:16,100
It's a little ruse of theirs.

793
00:49:16,520 --> 00:49:19,420
They coated the surface with a solution
and wrote words with their finger,

794
00:49:19,420 --> 00:49:20,680
causing the sprinkled

795
00:49:20,900 --> 00:49:22,490
incense ash to stick and reveal the text.

796
00:49:21,310 --> 00:49:22,440
[Silly]

797
00:49:22,750 --> 00:49:25,180
Then how did they make corpses
drift against the current?

798
00:49:25,180 --> 00:49:26,180
It's very simple.

799
00:49:26,810 --> 00:49:28,070
They had two good swimmers

800
00:49:27,140 --> 00:49:29,680
[Lyu Ruhui]

801
00:49:28,460 --> 00:49:29,590
dive into the water,

802
00:49:30,140 --> 00:49:31,870
using reed stalks to breathe.

803
00:49:32,310 --> 00:49:33,710
The reed stalks are very thin,

804
00:49:33,710 --> 00:49:35,660
so people on the shore
can hardly see them.

805
00:49:35,660 --> 00:49:39,460
This creates the illusion of corpses
drifting against the current.

806
00:49:43,390 --> 00:49:45,320
What are they hoping to achieve...

807
00:49:46,750 --> 00:49:47,750
by doing all this?

808
00:49:50,580 --> 00:49:51,510
Fearmongering.

809
00:49:52,580 --> 00:49:53,870
The blind man Du used

810
00:49:53,870 --> 00:49:55,430
the tragic deaths of your family

811
00:49:55,430 --> 00:49:56,760
to scare the villagers.

812
00:49:57,390 --> 00:49:59,350
His goal was to raise money
under the guise of

813
00:49:59,350 --> 00:50:01,150
carrying out justice for heaven

814
00:50:01,180 --> 00:50:02,870
and rebuilding the Immortal Temple.

815
00:50:02,870 --> 00:50:04,620
The villagers were beyond terrified

816
00:50:04,620 --> 00:50:07,460
and rushed to donate money
to rebuild the temple.

817
00:50:07,980 --> 00:50:09,580
They couldn't have imagined

818
00:50:09,580 --> 00:50:10,390
that Blind Du

819
00:50:10,910 --> 00:50:12,710
had already fled with the money.

820
00:50:13,750 --> 00:50:15,580
Who is the mastermind...

821
00:50:17,980 --> 00:50:18,830
behind this?

822
00:50:20,310 --> 00:50:21,390
He should be...

823
00:50:24,230 --> 00:50:25,430
Zhang Dancheng.

824
00:50:27,620 --> 00:50:29,100
Zhang Dancheng.

825
00:50:33,460 --> 00:50:34,310
So...

826
00:50:36,580 --> 00:50:37,950
what should I do

827
00:50:39,300 --> 00:50:41,570
to take revenge on Tianxiang Sect?

828
00:50:44,810 --> 00:50:46,600
If you want to take revenge,

829
00:50:46,620 --> 00:50:48,620
you must understand Tianxiang Sect

830
00:50:48,750 --> 00:50:50,460
better than anyone else.

831
00:50:50,810 --> 00:50:51,500
They're ruthless,

832
00:50:51,500 --> 00:50:52,870
but you mustn't fear their ruthlessness.

833
00:50:52,870 --> 00:50:53,460
They're evil,

834
00:50:53,460 --> 00:50:55,460
but we must face their evil head-on.

835
00:50:56,100 --> 00:50:57,230
You must accurately

836
00:50:57,460 --> 00:50:58,830
calculate their every move

837
00:50:58,830 --> 00:51:00,390
and see through their every scheme.

838
00:51:00,390 --> 00:51:01,460
Only in this way

839
00:51:02,790 --> 00:51:03,950
can you get revenge.

840
00:51:06,660 --> 00:51:07,500
Sir,

841
00:51:08,130 --> 00:51:10,190
please accept me as your apprentice.

842
00:51:10,580 --> 00:51:12,240
As long as I can get revenge...

843
00:51:14,390 --> 00:51:16,120
I'm willing to learn anything.

844
00:51:47,390 --> 00:51:47,980
Okay.

845
00:51:48,870 --> 00:51:49,980
From now on,

846
00:51:50,700 --> 00:51:53,630
I, Jin Buhuan, am your mentor,
and you my apprentice.

847
00:52:03,120 --> 00:52:05,330
[In the next episode]

848
00:52:11,800 --> 00:52:14,330
May I ask what manner of hero
I'm dealing with?

849
00:52:14,520 --> 00:52:16,000
Let's talk it out.

850
00:52:16,720 --> 00:52:18,450
This fanfare isn't necessary.

851
00:52:18,660 --> 00:52:19,700
Turf?

852
00:52:24,780 --> 00:52:27,230
Your fate is dominated by
a fierce element of Fire.

853
00:52:27,230 --> 00:52:28,380
Within a month,

854
00:52:29,000 --> 00:52:30,800
your entire family will perish.

855
00:52:31,660 --> 00:52:32,270
Take him out.

856
00:52:32,270 --> 00:52:33,950
Chop him up to feed the dogs.
